  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/B63cKVVf/r-a-g-e-curseforge.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"507\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/kG4SN3Nh/about.png\" width=\"900\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模组添加了大量汽车、唱片和轮毂。每辆车都可以拆解和改装。模组内包含超过20种载具，可更换大量部件，每种载具拥有多种颜色、可工作的车灯及内饰灯光。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/TwkL3N8r/r-a-g-e-faq.png\" width=\"900\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">👨‍💻</span><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">为什么汽车比 *插入其他模组名称* 的车型小？<br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🕵️‍♂️</span>我的汽车按与世界1:1比例制作，不同于大多数模组采用的史蒂夫:1比例。但你可以在配置文件中调整车辆大小。只需将 R.A.G.E 分类下的 \"packVehicleScales\" 设置为 1.2 即可。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">👨‍💻</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">何时支持1.2X.X或更新版本？</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🕵️‍♂️</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">这</span>不取决于我，因为 R.A.G.E 仅是沉浸式载具的一个附加包。</span></strong></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hPmjktGs/r-a-g-e-links.png\" width=\"900\"></span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pheMFzcAwE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord 服务器</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@immersive_vehicles_rage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">R.A.G.E YouTube 频道</span></strong></span></span></a><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-vehicles-r.a.g.e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Modrinth</strong></a></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/c4BGdv96/special-spasibo.png\" width=\"1275\" height=\"79\"></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>MrMulle</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Wartich</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Oskiinus</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Sphase</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>CowboyCosmic</strong><br><br></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/HW0hyfQV/partners.png\" width=\"1275\" height=\"79\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/zfnRq7dC/OCPartner-sigil.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>",
